    "detailed_description": "<strong>Esoterica Order</strong><br>Jump into the unknown with this third person shooter, playing as a super soldier known as a Phantom. Taking on the enemy race called The Despair. You will be facing off against numerous threats from your typical infantry units to brute like tanks and even mechanical robots.<br><br><strong>Objective</strong><br>Each level has a ten-minute timer to take out the patrolling targets while it's unknown how many reinforcements may join the fight. Eliminate them all for victory!<br><br><strong>Power Weapons</strong><br>Such as shotguns and sniper rifles are placed in weapon crates across each level to help reach your goal. However, they are limited so be aware and choose wisely when to go for those weapons. Be advised, some crates may be empty as well.<br><br><strong>Death Is Your Ally</strong><br>Running low on ammo? No more power weapons to pick up as well? Be sure to get taken out. As a phantom death is no penalty. Jump back into the fight fully loaded.<br><br><strong>Dash</strong><br>The only ability you have that can be mastered. Use to dodge or even possible to glide over the battlefield.<br><br><strong>Disclaimers</strong><br>Losing in a level will restart match over. But <u>Quitting</u> you will start back at the beginning.",
